        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/603059fab7bc698b6965be50dd9d456e.poster.avif?t=1758928518\" width=586 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/603059fab7bc698b6965be50dd9d456e.webm?t=1758928518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/603059fab7bc698b6965be50dd9d456e.mp4?t=1758928518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultivate what matters. Cut away the rest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prune is a love letter to trees–a puzzle game about cultivating growth and the joy of letting go. Grow and shape your tree into the sunlight while avoiding the dangers of a hostile world. Bring life to a forgotten landscape and uncover a story hidden deep beneath the soil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elegant simplicity - click and drag to plant your tree. Then, as it quickly grows before your eyes, prune away unwanted branches. Bloom enough flowers to complete each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meditation - an antidote to today's overstimulated, always-on world. Take a deep breath, stay awhile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timeless story - explore the evolving dance between civilization and nature, seen through the quiet eyes of trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respects your time - a focused 1–2 hour experience designed to stay with you long after it ends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now on PC - experience every branch, bloom, and abstract landscape in full-screen detail, where every level is a piece of art. Enjoy the rich soundscape, featuring a beautifully orchestrated score by Kyle Preston.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper roots – finished the main story? Uncover additional challenges, for those who seek more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/177b1c184b4a1d756759161f4c14b9c3.poster.avif?t=1758928518\" width=960 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/177b1c184b4a1d756759161f4c14b9c3.webm?t=1758928518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/177b1c184b4a1d756759161f4c14b9c3.mp4?t=1758928518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/603059fab7bc698b6965be50dd9d456e.poster.avif?t=1758928518\" width=586 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/603059fab7bc698b6965be50dd9d456e.webm?t=1758928518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/603059fab7bc698b6965be50dd9d456e.mp4?t=1758928518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultivate what matters. Cut away the rest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prune is a love letter to trees–a puzzle game about cultivating growth and the joy of letting go. Grow and shape your tree into the sunlight while avoiding the dangers of a hostile world. Bring life to a forgotten landscape and uncover a story hidden deep beneath the soil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elegant simplicity - click and drag to plant your tree. Then, as it quickly grows before your eyes, prune away unwanted branches. Bloom enough flowers to complete each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meditation - an antidote to today's overstimulated, always-on world. Take a deep breath, stay awhile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timeless story - explore the evolving dance between civilization and nature, seen through the quiet eyes of trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respects your time - a focused 1–2 hour experience designed to stay with you long after it ends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now on PC - experience every branch, bloom, and abstract landscape in full-screen detail, where every level is a piece of art. Enjoy the rich soundscape, featuring a beautifully orchestrated score by Kyle Preston.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper roots – finished the main story? Uncover additional challenges, for those who seek more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/177b1c184b4a1d756759161f4c14b9c3.poster.avif?t=1758928518\" width=960 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/177b1c184b4a1d756759161f4c14b9c3.webm?t=1758928518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3903490/extras/177b1c184b4a1d756759161f4c14b9c3.mp4?t=1758928518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
